1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,163
Under the hood, only approved actions reach the chain.

2
00:00:03,163 --> 00:00:05,550
AI analysis runs with no keys.

3
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:07,868
An admin wallet signs one approval.

4
00:00:07,868 --> 00:00:12,129
Only then does the isolated issuer, the only part with a key, act.

5
00:00:12,129 --> 00:00:15,834
Our AgentProvenance contract records who proposed and who approved.

6
00:00:15,834 --> 00:00:17,197
Agents propose.

7
00:00:17,197 --> 00:00:18,443
Humans approve.

8
00:00:18,443 --> 00:00:19,743
Chains prove.

